    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输出 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\sim n</span>中每个数的因子有哪些，从小到大输出！</p>\n<p>比如：<span class=\"katex math inline\">n=10</span>，那么输出结果如下。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">1:1</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">2:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">3:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">4:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">5:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">6:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">6</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">7:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">7</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">8:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">8</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">9:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">3</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">9</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">10:1</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">10</span></p>\n<p>其中，每行冒号前的整数代表了 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\sim n</span> 的每个数，冒号后的的数字代表了这个整数有哪些因子，用空格隔开。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输出 1 \\sim n中每个数的因子有哪些，从小到大输出！\n比如：n=10，那么输出结果如下。\n1:1\n2:1 2\n3:1 3\n4:1 2 4\n5:1 5\n6:1 2 3 6\n7:1 7\n8:1 2 4 8\n9:1 3 9\n10:1 2 5 10\n其中，每行冒号前的整数代表了 1 \\sim n 的每个数，冒号后的的数字代表了这个整数有哪些因子，用空格隔开。"
